msgstr "OAuth kliento ID"

#: plugin.py:14
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API raktas"

#: plugin.py:27 plugin.py:48 templates/settings.html:5
msgid "Google Drive"
msgstr "Google Drive"

#: plugin.py:42
msgid "Settings updated."
msgstr "Nustatymai atnaujinti."

#: templates/settings.html:6
msgid ""
"Allow users to select images from Google Drive when creating new tasks. "
"Create the credentials below in the Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr ""
"Leiskite naudotojams kuriant naujas užduotis pasirinkti vaizdus iš Google "
"Drive. Sukurkite toliau nurodytus prisijungimo duomenis Google Cloud Console:"

#: templates/settings.html:8
msgid ""
"Create a project and enable the <b>Google Drive API</b> and the <b>Google "
"Picker API</b>."
msgstr ""
"Sukurkite projektą ir įjunkite <b>Google Drive API</b> bei <b>Google Picker "
"API</b>."

#: templates/settings.html:9
msgid ""
"Open <b>APIs & Services → OAuth consent screen</b> (Google Auth Platform). "
"Fill in <b>Branding</b>, then in <b>Audience</b> add your users as test "
"users or publish the app."
msgstr ""
"Atidarykite <b>APIs & Services → OAuth consent screen</b> (Google Auth "
"Platform). Užpildykite <b>Branding</b>, tada skiltyje <b>Audience</b> "
"pridėkite naudotojus kaip bandomuosius arba paskelbkite programą."

#: templates/settings.html:10
msgid "In <b>Data Access</b>, click <b>Add or remove scopes</b> and add:"
msgstr ""
"Skiltyje <b>Data Access</b> spustelėkite <b>Add or remove scopes</b> ir "
"pridėkite:"

#: templates/settings.html:11
msgid ""
"In <b>Clients</b>, create a client of type <b>Web application</b> and add "
"this address to the Authorized JavaScript origins:"
msgstr ""
"Skiltyje <b>Clients</b> sukurkite <b>Web application</b> tipo klientą ir "
"pridėkite šį adresą prie Authorized JavaScript origins:"

#: templates/settings.html:12
msgid ""
"In <b>APIs & Services → Credentials</b>, click <b>Create credentials → API "
"key</b>. Under <b>API restrictions</b>, choose <b>Restrict key</b> and "
"select the <b>Google Drive API</b> and the <b>Google Picker API</b>. "
"Optionally, under <b>Application restrictions</b>, choose <b>Websites</b> "
"and add:"
msgstr ""
"Skiltyje <b>APIs & Services → Credentials</b> spustelėkite <b>Create "
"credentials → API key</b>. Dalyje <b>API restrictions</b> pasirinkite "
"<b>Restrict key</b> ir pažymėkite <b>Google Drive API</b> bei <b>Google "
"Picker API</b>. Pasirinktinai dalyje <b>Application restrictions</b> "
"pasirinkite <b>Websites</b> ir pridėkite:"

#: templates/settings.html:14
msgid ""
"Google only accepts HTTPS addresses or http://localhost as JavaScript "
"origins."
msgstr ""
"Google priima tik HTTPS adresus arba http://localhost kaip JavaScript "
"šaltinius."

#: templates/settings.html:15
msgid "Open Google Cloud Console"
msgstr "Atidaryti Google Cloud Console"

#: templates/settings.html:20
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Išsaugoti"
